task (completed) {
  create ./create_embeddings.py:
  - it should have one cil argument <youtube_video_hash>
  - logic:
  - remove all existing ./youtube_transcript/<youtube_video_hash>.*.embedding files
  - for all {trunk_file}, {trunk_file_index_starting_from_1} in ./youtube_transcript/<youtube_video_hash>.*.trunk:
  - embedding: use ollama local model embeddinggemma-2:570m to create an embedding for {the content of {trunk_file}}
  - save {embedding} to ./youtube_transcript/<youtube_video_hash>.{trunk_file_index_starting_from_1}.embedding
}

task (completed) {
  create ./create_trunks.py:
  - it should have one cil argument <youtube_video_hash>
  - logic:
  - remove all existing ./youtube_transcript/<youtube_video_hash>.*.trunk files
  - rewritten_content: read the content of ./youtube_transcript/<youtube_video_hash>.rewrite
  for each {paragraph}, {paragraph_index_starting_from_1} in {rewritten_content}:
  - paragraph: trim all spaces and new lines around {paragraph}
  - trunk: 
  <article><title>{content of ./youtube_transcript/<youtube_video_hash>.title}</title><paragraph>{paragraph}</paragraph></article>
  - save {trunk} to ./youtube_transcript/<youtube_video_hash>.{paragraph_index_starting_from_1}.trunk
}

task (completed) {
  create ./rewrite.py:
  - it should have one cil argument <youtube_video_hash>
  - logic:
  - transcript_content: take .youtube_transcript/<youtube_video_hash>.transcript 
  - rewritten_content: use ollama model ornith:35b to rewrite {transcript_content}
  - note: 
  - during the transcript rewriting process, extract all the detail knowledges
  - during the transcript rewriting process, stream the rewritten content to the terminal
  - the rewritten_content should contain short paragraphs, each paragraph should serve as a piece of knowlege, the paragraph will be used as a trunk that will be used in RAG
  - save {rewritten_content} to ./youtube_transcript/<youtube_video_hash>.rewrite 
}

task (completed) {
  create ./fetch_youtube_transcript.py:
  - it should have one cli argument <youtube_video_hash>
  example: FTwxtyOEGyM
  we then fetch the english transcript of https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FTwxtyOEGyM
  - it should use free youtube api to fetch the transcript of a youtube video
  - use ollama model ornith:35b to summarize transcript into 20 words and store into ./youtube_transcript/<youtube_video_hash>.title
  - the transcript should be stored in ./youtube_transcript/<youtube_video_hash>.transcript
}
